It's not immediately visible in this manner, no. Water is only found
on the Plane of Water. For an } elsewhere, you can experiment on
drying it up, as above; push a boulder into it (in the description of
which case pools will be "pool of water", moats will be "moat" except
on Juiblex' level where they will be "swamp" or Medusa's where they
will be "water"); or waterwalk on it and dip something into it
(messages changing likewise).

